<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλλία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάππαρις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.173
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>foliage, leaf-buds</i> or <i>twigs</i>, esp. of the olive,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.1.3
			</span></i> (cod. Urb.), <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.459
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.75
			</span></i> (v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				2.70
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.23.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.29
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.20.3
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλλίας</span> cod. Urb.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλείας</span> vulg. as in <i><span class="en">
				3.5.1
			</span></i> (sg.), <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				33
			</span></i>); in codd. sts. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλία</span>, as
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.3.3
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				5.1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάτου θαλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.41
				</span></i>
			.</div>
